      T-003 owns F18.1 and AC-LEGITIMATE-POSITIONALS (positionals live in module /
      verification / file, all wired in the class rollout).

      Gate subcommand resolution (A31.4): parent gate run still short-circuits when
      first non-dash token is approve|apply|archive|verdict. Counterweight in T-002:
      gate approve still evaluates with --record=false for read-only probes.

